{"availability":"available","full":"bilalpiaic/Easy-Books","name":"Easy-Books","description":"Open-source multi-tenant bookkeeping for SMEs — 5 business models, IFRS-aligned double-entry GL. FastAPI + SQLModel backend · Next.js 16 + React 19. Runs as a Windows/macOS desktop app, Docker Compose office server, or one-click script installer.","category":"Business","language":"Python","stars":6,"forks":5,"created":"2026-04-29T20:00:35Z","updated":"2026-10-11T06:55:08Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://easy-books-erp.vercel.app/","topics":["accounting","bookkeeping","docker","double-entry","erp","fastapi","ifrs","invoicing","nextjs","postgresql","python","react","saas","self-hosted","sqlite","sqlmodel","typescript"],"demo":"https://easy-books-erp.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:27:08.350Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T07:27:08.350Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T07:27:08.350Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T07:27:08.350Z","stars":6,"forks":5}],"technologies":["React","Next.js","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Easy-Books is a multi-tenant double-entry bookkeeping SaaS for SMEs. Everyone starts on Base Accounting. Capabilities are Add-ons, grouped by category of use: Operations (inventory, manufacturing, purchases/store, POS, eCommerce, weighbridge), HR, Business nature (telecom, healthcare, weaving, spinning, textile processing), Country & statutory (Pakistan FBR, UAE VAT, ZATCA, India GST, Peppol, UK MTD, Malaysia MyInvois), and Intelligence (AI Assistant). Install after login from System → Add-ons. IAS/IFRS-aligned accounting with an enforced ∑Dr = ∑Cr invariant and live reports from the General…","Stack: FastAPI + SQLModel (backend) · Next.js 16 + React 19 + Tailwind v4 (frontend) · SQLite for dev/local, PostgreSQL for production."],"features":["Multi-level Chart of Accounts — group/parent accounts with child leaves (the default CoA every tenant gets is hierarchical); posting is restricted to active leaf accounts, and parent balances roll up automatically","Double-entry GL with services/posting.py as the single, invariant-enforcing write path","Voucher series — typed vouchers (Sales / Purchase / Receipt / Payment / Journal / Credit-Note / Debit-Note) with per-type numbering, plus Cash Book & Bank Book views","Decimal money throughout (NUMERIC(18,4), banker's rounding) — no floating-point drift","Weighted-Average inventory costing (IAS 2); optional FIFO per tenant"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bilalpiaic/Easy-Books/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"fc3805fc95b0a24f51bba36b85e75a0592ee494907b1e35f8e1748e2d4d7c0c5","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T07:27:08.435Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:27:08.435Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Easy-Books is a multi-tenant double-entry bookkeeping SaaS for SMEs. Everyone starts on Base Accounting. Capabilities are Add-ons, grouped by category of use: Operations (inventory, manufacturing, purchases/store, POS, eCommerce, weighbridge), HR, Business nature (telecom, healthcare, weaving, spinning, textile processing), Country & statutory (Pakistan FBR, UAE VAT, ZATCA, India GST, Peppol, UK MTD, Malaysia MyInvois), and Intelligence (AI Assistant). Install after login from System → Add-ons. IAS/IFRS-aligned accounting with an enforced ∑Dr = ∑Cr invariant and live reports from the General…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bilalpiaic/Easy-Books/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Install after login from System → Add-ons.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bilalpiaic/Easy-Books/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Auto-check on login — admin/owner users see an UpdateAvailablePopup automatically when a newer commit is on the main branch (detects via GitHub Commits API, not Releases — catches every push)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bilalpiaic/Easy-Books/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Model & API Key, right in the chat — a button in the chat header opens a panel to pick a model or add a provider key on the spot (admin/owner for the key; anyone can pick a model), so a fresh install's chat is never a dead end with no visible way to configure it","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bilalpiaic/Easy-Books/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"Gate Inward (GI-YYYY-seq) — receipt control between PO approval and billing: per-line quantity caps against the PO, PO status flips approved↔received as coverage completes, append-only (cancel requires a reason, no edits). requiregateinward (Settings, default on) blocks converting a PO to a bill until every line is fully covered","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bilalpiaic/Easy-Books/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"fc3805fc95b0a24f51bba36b85e75a0592ee494907b1e35f8e1748e2d4d7c0c5","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bilalpiaic/Easy-Books/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T07:27:08.437Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T06:55:08Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bilalpiaic/Easy-Books/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T07:27:08.442Z","hash":"fc3805fc95b0a24f51bba36b85e75a0592ee494907b1e35f8e1748e2d4d7c0c5","originalBytes":48181,"storedBytes":48181,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["data","demo","backend","every","per","run","api","frontend","install","inventory","tenant","via","gate","settings","reports","app","easy-books.app","live","docs","line","stock","user","when","across","default","desktop","easy-books","full","invoice","module","never","any","bash","before","invoices","print","purchase","seed","store","stripe","admin","bank","deployment","first","login","one","page","payment","product","production","report","revenue","runs","spinning","accounts","aging","automatically","balance","bill","bills","build","dashboard","dev","docker","each","ias","marketplace","new","orders","pdf","public","sales","se